### Problem

given a family of paths, how can we generate a valid path that is a member of that family?

### Solution

1. add a node at the head of the DAG to represent the root node of the family
2. for each path in the family, add an edge from the root node to the head of the path
3. for each path in the family, add an edge from the head of the path to the tail of the path

